      "category": "Text",
      "text": "AMENDING EXECUTIVE ORDER NO. 38 DATED FEBRUARY 7, 1967\nIN RELATION TO THE DUTIES, RESPONSIBILITIES AND AUTHORITY\nOF THE DIRECTOR OF LABOR RELATIONS",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2537,
