    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        314,
        803,
        1235,
        871
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Executive Order No. 38 was issued in 1967, superseding certain previously issued Executive Orders which related to the conduct of labor relations between the City of New York and its employees; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2515,
          "min": -1.288
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 45,
          "mean": -0.0024,
          "min": -0.1005
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11138,
        "area_px": 63963,
        "density": 0.17413,
        "chars": 206,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.5
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        316,
        868,
        1235,
        913
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Experience in labor relations since the issuance of Executive Order No. 38 has shown that clarification of the Order is desirable; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2249,
          "min": -1.2447
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 29,
          "mean": -0.0135,
          "min": -0.387
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7406,
        "area_px": 42550,
        "density": 0.17405,
        "chars": 143,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.31
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        316,
        912,
        1235,
        956
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, In order to effectuate such changes, it is necessary to amend Executive Order No. 38.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1989,
          "min": -1.1321
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 24,
          "mean": -0.0033,
          "min": -0.0381
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 4868,
        "area_px": 41625,
        "density": 0.11695,
        "chars": 94,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.31
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        316,
        955,
        1235,
        1001
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, by the power vested in me as Mayor of the City of New York, it is hereby ordered as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1757,
          "min": -0.9917
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 26,
          "mean": -0.0011,
          "min": -0.0235
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 5149,
        "area_px": 44400,
        "density": 0.11597,
        "chars": 108,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.97
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        316,
        999,
        1235,
        1045
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Executive Order No. 38 dated February 7, 1967, is hereby amended by adding thereto a new section 4(a) to read as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.1769,
          "min": -1.0944
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0128,
          "min": -0.0128
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 41,
